            <node id="4" label="alsa-ucm-conf">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="ALSA Use Case Manager configuration files" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="ALSA Use Case Manager configuration files&#10; This package contains ALSA Use Case Manager configuration of audio&#10; input/output names and routing for specific audio hardware. They can be&#10; used with the alsaucm tool.&#10; .&#10; Installing these configuration files is absolutely necessary to make some&#10; sound hardware work. Its installation is highly recommended in order to&#10; use ALSA-backed hardware.&#10; .&#10; ALSA is the Advanced Linux Sound Architecture." />
                    <attvalue for="3" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="4" value="1515" />
