            <node id="174" label="libblas3:amd64">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="Basic Linear Algebra Reference implementations, shared library" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="Basic Linear Algebra Reference implementations, shared library&#10; BLAS (Basic Linear Algebra Subroutines) is a set of efficient&#10; routines for most of the basic vector and matrix operations.&#10; They are widely used as the basis for other high quality linear&#10; algebra software, for example lapack and linpack.  This&#10; implementation is the Fortran 77 reference implementation found&#10; at netlib.&#10; .&#10; This package contains a shared version of the library." />
