            <node id="177" label="libbrotli1:amd64">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="library implementing brotli encoder and decoder (shared libraries)" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="library implementing brotli encoder and decoder (shared libraries)&#10; Brotli is a generic-purpose lossless compression algorithm&#10; that compresses data using a combination of a modern variant&#10; of the LZ77 algorithm, Huffman coding and 2nd order context modeling,&#10; with a compression ratio comparable to the best currently available&#10; general-purpose compression methods. It is similar in speed with&#10; deflate but offers more dense compression.&#10; .&#10; This package installs shared libraries." />
                    <attvalue for="3" value="[]" />
