                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="Helper functions for handling strings (lib)" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="Helper functions for handling strings (lib)&#10; The 'libestr' library contains some essential string manipulation&#10; functions and more, like escaping special characters.&#10; .&#10; This package contains the shared library." />
