            <node id="450" label="libxkbfile1:amd64">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="X11 keyboard file manipulation library" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="X11 keyboard file manipulation library&#10; libxkbfile provides an interface to read and manipulate description files for&#10; XKB, the X11 keyboard configuration extension.&#10; .&#10; More information about X.Org can be found at:&#10; &lt;URL:http://www.X.org&gt;&#10; .&#10; This module can be found at&#10; git://anongit.freedesktop.org/git/xorg/lib/libxkbfile" />
                    <attvalue for="3" value="[]" />
