            <node id="475" label="logrotate">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="Log rotation utility" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="Log rotation utility&#10; The logrotate utility is designed to simplify the administration of&#10; log files on a system which generates a lot of log files.  Logrotate&#10; allows for the automatic rotation compression, removal and mailing of&#10; log files.  Logrotate can be set to handle a log file daily, weekly,&#10; monthly or when the log file gets to a certain size.  Normally, logrotate&#10; runs as a daily cron job." />
                    <attvalue for="3" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="4" value="145" />
                    <attvalue for="5" value="no" />
                    <attvalue for="6" value="Ubuntu Developers &lt;ubuntu-devel-discuss@lists.ubuntu.com&gt;" />
