                    <attvalue for="2" value="comprehensive HTTP client library written for Python3&#10; httplib2.py supports many features left out of other HTTP libraries.&#10;  * HTTP and HTTPS&#10;  * Keep-Alive&#10;  * Authentication&#10;  * Caching&#10;  * All Methods&#10;  * Redirects&#10;  * Compression&#10;  * Lost update support&#10;  * Unit Tested&#10; .&#10; This package provides module for python3 series." />
