                    <attvalue for="0" value="JSON Schema meta-schemas and vocabularies, exposed as a Registry" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="JSON Schema meta-schemas and vocabularies, exposed as a Registry&#10; This package contains JSON support files from the JSON Schema Specifications&#10; (metaschemas, vocabularies, etc.), packaged for runtime access from Python as&#10; a referencing-based Schema Registry.&#10; .&#10; This package contains the Python 3.x module." />
