            <node id="594" label="python3-pathspec">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="utility library for gitignore style pattern matching of file paths (Python 3)" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="utility library for gitignore style pattern matching of file paths (Python 3)&#10; pathspec is a utility library for pattern matching of file paths.&#10; So far this only includes Git's wildmatch pattern matching which itself is&#10; derived from Rsync's wildmatch. Git uses wildmatch for its gitignore files.&#10; .&#10; This package installs the library for Python 3." />
