            <node id="618" label="python3-service-identity">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="Service identity verification for pyOpenSSL (Python 3 module)" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="Service identity verification for pyOpenSSL (Python 3 module)&#10; Service_identity aspires to give you all the tools you need for verifying&#10; whether a certificate is valid for the intended purposes.&#10; .&#10; In the simplest case, this means host name verification.  However,&#10; service_identity implements RFC 6125 fully and plans to add other&#10; relevant RFCs too.&#10; .&#10; This package contains service_identity for Python 3." />
