                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="Tkinter - Writing Tk applications with Python 3.x" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="Tkinter - Writing Tk applications with Python 3.x&#10; A module for writing portable GUI applications with Python 3.x using Tk.&#10; Also known as Tkinter. Debian breaks out the Tkinter module from the Python&#10; standard library to reduce the dependency footprint.&#10; .&#10; The package currently depends on python3.14-tk. In the&#10; future, dependencies on jython (Python for a JVM) and ironpython (Python for&#10; Mono) may be added.&#10; .&#10; Note that this package will not force the installation of all supported Python&#10; interpreters, it only makes sure that the modules are available." />
