                    <attvalue for="1" value='[[{"name": "mitmproxy", "op": "&lt;&lt;", "version": "5.0~"}], [{"name": "pcs", "op": "&lt;&lt;", "version": "0.10.5-1~"}]]' />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="scalable, non-blocking web server and tools - Python 3 package&#10; Tornado is a Python web framework and asynchronous networking library,&#10; originally developed at FriendFeed. By using non-blocking network I/O,&#10; Tornado can scale to tens of thousands of open connections, making it ideal&#10; for long polling, WebSockets, and other applications that require a&#10; long-lived connection to each user.&#10; .&#10; This is the Python 3 version of the package." />
