            <node id="689" label="vim">
                <attvalues>
                    <attvalue for="0" value="Vi IMproved - enhanced vi editor" />
                    <attvalue for="1" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="2" value="Vi IMproved - enhanced vi editor&#10; Vim is an almost compatible version of the UNIX editor Vi.&#10; .&#10; Many new features have been added: multi level undo, syntax&#10; highlighting, command line history, on-line help, filename&#10; completion, block operations, folding, Unicode support, etc.&#10; .&#10; This package contains a version of vim compiled with a rather&#10; standard set of features.  This package does not provide a GUI&#10; version of Vim.  See the other vim-* packages if you need more&#10; (or less)." />
                    <attvalue for="3" value="[]" />
                    <attvalue for="4" value="4566" />
                    <attvalue for="5" value="no" />
